# Repo-root .gitignore. Per-subtree ignores (backend/, frontend/) still
# live in those subdirectories' own .gitignore files; this one covers what
# the compose stack adds at the root.

# Host-level env for `docker compose` (the file .env.example documents).
# Mirrors backend/.gitignore and frontend/.gitignore — every level that can
# have an .env must ignore it. A leaked POSTGRES_PASSWORD or RESEND_API_KEY
# is the kind of thing that's expensive to find out about late.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example

.DS_Store

# Local SQLite backups (e.g. audithealth.db.bak.YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS) — never commit.
*.db.bak*

# Playwright-MCP browser logs (local tooling artifacts).
.playwright-mcp/

# Internal planning / cost / build-prompt docs — kept LOCAL, never published.
# (Root-level markdown only; README.md is the one public doc. Subdir docs and
# the screenshot folders are unaffected.)
/*.md
/.*.md
!/README.md
/claude_prompts/

# Stray root-level screenshot / test PNGs — kept local (screenshot folders OK).
/*.png

# Local Claude config / memory — never published.
.claude/

# Local secrets reference — already covered by /*.md above, but pinned here
# explicitly so it stays ignored even if the root-markdown rule is relaxed.
# NEVER commit this file: it holds live API keys.
credentials.md
credentials.*.md

# Stale screenshot dumps — superseded by screenshots/ (kept local).
/audit_walkthrough_screenshots/
/walkthrough_2026-05-27_mobile/
/competitor_corrections_screens/
/competitor_final_polish_screens/
/competitor_mobile_screens/
/competitor_polish_screens/
/competitor_recon_screenshots/
/misc_ui_screenshots/
